#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.chrome:agentTools.docsDescription"
msgid "Pantoken publishes fetchable documentation and manifests for assistants that can browse URLs or read raw Markdown."
msgstr "Ka whakaputaina e Pantoken he tuhinga me ngā manifest e taea te tiki mā te āwhina e pānui ana i ngā URL, i te raw Markdown rānei."

#: docs/.vitepress/i18n.json
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.chrome:agentTools.installPrompt"
msgid "Install Pantoken agent guidance in this repository. Use {{command}}, then summarize the files written and when future agents should read them."
msgstr "Tāuta ngā aratohu kaiāgentu Pantoken i tēnei putunga. Whakamahia te {{command}}, ā, whakaahuatia ngā kōnae kua tuhia me te wā e tika ana kia pānuitia e ngā kaiāgentu ā muri ake."

#: docs/.vitepress/i18n.json
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.chrome:agentTools.registryPrompt"
msgid "Use the Pantoken shadcn registry for this project. Fetch https://pantoken.app/r/registry.json, then run {{command}} if the project uses shadcn or has components.json. Registry items install CSS and metadata, not React components."
msgstr "Whakamahia te rēhita shadcn a Pantoken mō tēnei kaupapa. Tikiake https://pantoken.app/r/registry.json, ā, katahi ka whakahaere i te {{command}} mēnā ka whakamahia e te kaupapa te shadcn, ā, mēnā he components.json. Ka tāuta ngā taonga rēhita i ngā CSS me te metadata, ehara i ngā waahanga React."

#: docs/.vitepress/i18n.json
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.chrome:agentTools.docsPrompt"
msgid "Fetch https://pantoken.app/llms.txt first. When a page is needed, prefer its raw Markdown URL by adding .md to the clean docs path, and use Pantoken manifests for component capabilities, CDN plugins, demos, and registry items."
msgstr "Tikiake https://pantoken.app/llms.txt tuatahi. Mēnā e hiahiatia ana he whārangi, whakamahia te URL Markdown mata mā te tāpiri .md ki te ara tuhinga ma, ā, whakamahia ngā manifest a Pantoken mō ngā āheinga wahanga, ngā pūtirotiro CDN, ngā whakaaturanga, me ngā taonga rēhita."

#: docs/.vitepress/i18n.json
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.chrome:agentTools.docsCommand"
msgid "Fetch https://pantoken.app/llms.txt, then follow links to the pages and manifests relevant to this task."
msgstr "Tikiake https://pantoken.app/llms.txt, ā, whai i ngā hononga ki ngā whārangi me ngā manifest e hāngai ana ki tēnei mahi."

